# Education slide PPT style

New or edited slides must look like the current 38 slides. Do not write custom slide layouts.

## Structure
- Canvas is 1920×1080 via `FixedSlideCanvas`. Never add per-slide scale overrides.
- Every slide = `SlideFrame` from `education/slides/shared/SlideFrame.tsx` + exactly one diagram from `shared/diagrams.tsx`, optionally followed by `OutcomeBar`.
- `SlideFrame` props: `page` (global 1–N), `lesson`, `kicker` (`'ENGLISH · 한글'`), `title`, `subtitle`, `icon` (lucide hero icon, always set).
- Diagrams: `StepFlow` (sequence), `CycleLoop` (4-step loop + center), `HubSpokes` (center + 4–6 items), `CompareColumns` (2–3 columns; rose=bad, amber=hold, others=good), `PointTiles` (3–5 key points), `KeywordRow` (cover/summary), `CheckList` (mission/criteria), `Funnel`, `LayerStack`.
- Every diagram item gets a `tone` and a lucide `icon`. Tones: blue, sky, cyan, teal, emerald, indigo, purple, amber, rose.

## Text rules
- Title ≤ ~16 Korean chars, subtitle one short line, item labels ≤ ~8 chars. No sentences, fake app screenshots, or mock dashboards on the slide.
- Every explanatory sentence goes into `explanation.details` (`{ heading, body[] }[]`) in `components/slides/content/lesson{N}Explanations.ts`. The panel under the slide opens it by default.
- Keep `summary`, `why`, `onoffUse`, `action` filled as before.

## Example
```tsx
export const Slide08Step04Indexing: React.FC = () => (
  <SlideFrame page={8} lesson={1} kicker="STEP 04 · 색인" title="써야 검색되는 것이 아닙니다"
    subtitle="발행 → 크롤 → 색인 → 노출" icon={SearchCheck}>
    <div className="w-full">
      <StepFlow steps={[
        { label: '발행', tone: 'blue', icon: Send },
        { label: '사이트맵', tone: 'sky', icon: Map },
        { label: '크롤링', tone: 'cyan', icon: Bug },
        { label: '색인', tone: 'teal', icon: Database },
      ]} />
      <OutcomeBar label="GSC URL 검사로 색인 확인" icon={SearchCheck} />
    </div>
  </SlideFrame>
);
```

## Adding a slide
1. Add the visual in `lesson0N/visuals/`, export it from that `index.ts`, and register it in `slideCatalog.ts` / `slideDeckRegistry.tsx`.
2. Add its learning content with `details` keyed by slug.
3. Run `npx tsc --noEmit`, check with `qa-slides.html` locally, deploy with `scripts/deploy-seo-system-300.sh`.
